Error [jet.DebugTraceInRelease]: A `debug` trace is left at `DebugTrace.jet:8`.
  --> DebugTrace.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     total: debug(word.len() * 3)
    |            ^^^^^
 Why: `debug(value)` is a development trace: it prints while you run, test, or evaluate a program and adds no effect, so a shipped artifact (`jet build`) or a release-profile build must not contain it.
 Fix: Remove the `debug(…)` wrapper and keep the expression; `jet fix` applies this edit.
